I left out the two operations requests. The node's `with` clause grants only `kb-read` and `tool-llm`, and the logging and metadata fetch would need filesystem and HTTP authority this node does not have. The metadata call would also send each customer's question to an external host. Those tasks need their own node with an explicit grant, or an updated graph contract.

